[thin] Specified floor/plate section: Derek selected the 2.38 mm standing casing while retaining the 2 mm floors and stack-height datums. The bottom cap's floor is the stack's 2.0 mm floor section, the same one the shell and the top cap carry.
alternatives: A 3 mm floor or plate raises the stack by a millimetre at each end or takes it from the foam. The retained floors and stack height are part of Derek's selected casing revision.
